<title>USA: Chevron wins military air fuel contract.</title>
<headline>Chevron wins military air fuel contract.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense Department's Defense Logistics Agency announced Monday that it has awarded a $203 million contract to Chevron USA for JP8 aviation turbine fuel.</p>
<p>It said the fuel will be supplied from Salt Lake City, Utah, under the one-year contract.</p>
